Overall, these empirical results provide strong evidence that the LSTM-BEKK model offers superior risk-adjusted performance in high-dimensional GMV portfolio construction. Its consistent outperformance in both AV and MDD metrics suggests that integrating deep learning structures into volatility modeling leads to more stable, resilient, and defensible portfolios under real-world market conditions.

