	 Procedure~\ref{alg:rcv} and Procedure~\ref{alg:send} are designed to realize the \verb*|receive-search| and \verb*|send-search| operations of each node respectively. Here, in the procedures,
	\begin{itemize}
		\item $\mathscr{B}$ is the memory, and $\mathscr{B}_j[k]$ represents the $k^{th}$ bit of the memory at node $j$.
		%	\item $n$ is the number of nodes in the Cayley tree.
