\textbf{KnoVo Operation} & \textbf{Core Function(s)} & \textbf{Avg. Time (s)} & \textbf{LLM Model Used} \\
\midrule
Initial Dimension Extraction & $\Lambda_{\text{extract}}$ & 37.42 & gemma3:27b \\
