    \caption{Momentum dependence of the single-nucleon potential in SNM $U_{0}(\rho,p)$, at $\rho=\rho_0/4$, $\rho_0/2$, and $\rho_0$, respectively.
    The vertical lines indicate the corresponding Fermi momenta.}
