+\frac{t_{3}^{[3]}}{16} \rho^{6/3} +\frac{t_{3}^{[5]}}{16} \rho^{8/3}  \\
&+\frac{1}{12 \pi^{4} \hbar^{6} \rho_{0} \rho}  \sum_{i=1}^{3} \left( C_{l,i}+C_{u,i} \right) \Lambda_{i}^{2}
