Then taking in considerations the results from Section~\ref{sec:3.1} we modify the solution representation (\ref{solrep}) and
construct regularized BIEs to solve the thermoelastic open-arc scattering problems. The regularized solution representations and BIEs for the four cases of boundary conditions are listed in Table~\ref{RsolrepHIE}. 
